# [CCAMP](../wg/ccamp.html)

## Summary

The CCAMP Working Group met at IETF 126. The session covered the status of active working group drafts, liaison agreements, and progressed several key items, including DWDM interfaces, WDM tunnels, Microwave links, and performance monitoring streaming. The working group also discussed several new proposals addressing the intersection of optical networks, service level agreements (SLAs), and artificial intelligence (AI) computing orchestration.

The agenda was bashed prior to the session to accommodate traveling constraints, moving the Microwave Radio Link presentation to the third slot.

---

