### 4. Microwave Radio Link
* **Presenter**: Jonas Allberg
* **Slides**: [A YANG Data Model for Microwave Radio Link](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/126/materials/slides-126-ccamp-a-yang-data-model-for-microwave-radio-link-00)
* **Discussion**:
  * Jonas Allberg presented an update on the individual draft (renamed to include "ccamp") intended to update RFC 8561.
  * The team is working through a list of open issues, including the mode of the radio link (changing from configurable to read-only), space diversity, loopback functions, cross-polarization interference cancellation, and carrier aggregation.
  * Ramon Casellas noted an issue with the IPR poll due to an unreachable contributor who has left their company. Daniele Ceccarelli suggested moving the individual to the acknowledgements section to clear the block and proceed with a working group adoption call.

